Mythforge
=========

Mythforge is a single-player, offline tabletop RPG whose Game Master is a
language model running on your own machine.

It began as a fork of Odysseus, a third-party MIT-licensed self-hosted AI
workspace. The MIT license that came with that work is preserved in LICENSE and
this attribution is kept because the project's history derives from it.

  Odysseus — https://github.com/pewdiepie-archdaemon/odysseus
  Copyright (c) 2025 Odysseus Contributors
  MIT License (see LICENSE)

What remains of that platform is nothing that runs. The server, chat streaming,
auth, sessions, presets, model and endpoint management, galleries and their
supporting services have been removed. What ships is a Godot game that runs its
own language model in-process, and a small set of art tooling.

Third-party runtime components are credited in ACKNOWLEDGMENTS.md.

